"height":38},{"text":"변경될","x":1497,"y":2264,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"상태를","x":1616,"y":2264,"width":108,"height":39}]},{"text":"저장하고, 인터럽트 원인을 확인하고, 필요한 처리를 수행하고, 상태 복원을 수행하고,","words":[{"text":"저장하고,","x":349,"y":2321,"width":144,"height":40},{"text":"인터럽트","x":514,"y":2322,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"원인을","x":667,"y":2322,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"확인하고,","x":786,"y":2323,"width":147,"height":39},{"text":"필요한","x":953,"y":2323,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"처리를","x":1076,"y":2324,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"수행하고,","x":1193,"y":2325,"width":149,"height":40},{"text":"상태","x":1360,"y":2328,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"복원을","x":1448,"y":2328,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"수행하고,","x":1572,"y":2328,"width":152,"height":39}]},{"text":"return-from-interrupt 명령어를 실행하여 CPU를 인터럽트 전 실행 상태로 되돌","words":[{"text":"return-from-interrupt","x":347,"y":2393,"width":432,"height":34},{"text":"명령어를","x":800,"y":2386,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"실행하여","x":952,"y":2387,"width":134,"height":40},{"text":"CPU를","x":1105,"y":2390,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"인터럽트","x":1241,"y":2389,"width":138,"height":39},{"text":"전","x":1396,"y":2391,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"실행","x":1446,"y":2391,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"상태로","x":1531,"y":2391,"width":107,"height":39},{"text":"되돌","x":1654,"y":2392,"width":71,"height":38}]},{"text":"린다. 장지 컨트롤러가 인터럽트 요청 라인에 신호를 선언하여 인터럽트를 V4(raise)","words":[{"text":"린다.","x":350,"y":2450,"width":74,"height":38},{"text":"장지","x":442,"y":2450,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"컨트롤러가","x":529,"y":2450,"width":172,"height":39},{"text":"인터럽트","x":717,"y":2450,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"요청","x":869,"y":2451,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"라인에","x":955,"y":2451,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"신호를","x":1075,"y":2452,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"선언하여","x":1194,"y":2452,"width":134,"height":40},{"text":"인터럽트를","x":1351,"y":2454,"width":176,"height":39},{"text":"V4(raise)","x":1546,"y":2456,"width":178,"height":42}]},{"text":"시기고 CPU는 인터럽트를 포*h(catch)하여 인터럽트 핸들러로 니스*/(dispatch)하","words":[{"text":"시기고","x":350,"y":2513,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"CPU는","x":467,"y":2517,"width":117,"height":34},{"text":"인터럽트를","x":602,"y":2514,"width":170,"height":39},{"text":"포*h(catch)하여","x":784,"y":2515,"width":253,"height":41},{"text":"인터럽트","x":1059,"y":2515,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"핸들러로","x":1211,"y":2516,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"니스*/(dispatch)하","x":1369,"y":2518,"width":357,"height":47}]},{"text":"고 핸들러는 장치를 서비스하여 인터럽트를 지운다(clear). 그림 1.4는 인터럽트-구동","words":[{"text":"고","x":349,"y":2582,"width":34,"height":27},{"text":"핸들러는","x":400,"y":2577,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"장치를","x":553,"y":2578,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"서비스하여","x":674,"y":2578,"width":167,"height":39},{"text":"인터럽트를","x":864,"y":2579,"width":170,"height":37},{"text":"지운다(clear).","x":1049,"y":2579,"width":223,"height":41},{"text":"그림","x":1292,"y":2581,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"1.4는","x":1380,"y":2584,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"인터럽트-구동","x":1484,"y":2583,"width":242,"height":40}]}]}